## What we vendored

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `templates/semantic/` | PBIP/TMDL patterns (compat 1702, pbism 4.2, what-if GENERATESERIES) |
| `templates/report/` | PBIR `definition/` layout (version.json, pages/, report.json) |
| `templates/visuals/` | Selected `.github/pbi.kb` visualContainer JSON + a simple `tableEx` |
| `docs/tableau-dax-translation-guide.md` | DAX gotchas (compact-filter VAR hoist, LOD, parameters) |

## What we did **not** take

- Copilot CLI / agent orchestration
- Full example extracts, credentials, or migration-spec machinery
- Runtime dependency on the upstream Python package

BIEscape keeps its own AST parser (`engine/parser.py`) and formula transpiler
(`engine/transpiler.py`). Vendored files are **pattern templates** filled by
`engine/pbip/`.
